5. SENSITIVITY TO TOPOLOGY ERROR
==========================================================================
     switch-state error rate   verdict agreement
                        0.00              100.0%
                        0.05               81.0%
                        0.10               67.5%
                        0.20               46.5%
  Reachability verdicts are only as good as the connectivity model;
  this quantifies how good it has to be.

==========================================================================
6. SCALING AND OVERHEAD
==========================================================================
      DERs   buses   mean us/event    p95 us
        13      33          1312.1    1368.7
        50      33          2109.4    2154.3
       200      33          4792.9    4952.2
      1000      33         18280.3   18748.7
  NOTE: unlike the mission instantiation, cost here is dominated by the
  per-segment reachability traversal, which is independent of the DER
  count -- 13 DERs already cost most of what 200 do. The DER population
  adds a sub-linear term on top. The obvious optimisation is to cache
  downstream sets per topology and invalidate them on a switch change,
  which we have NOT done: these are unoptimised figures.
